Why are you Romeo ?
You have betrayed me .
What light is breaking through that window over there ?
Is this a dagger that I see in front of me ?
Please , tell me your name .
You are a villain .
Do you love me ?
I do not know why I am so sad .
I think the lady protests too much .
It is only your name that is my enemy .
Will you leave ?
I will not talk with you .
Come here , boy .
Your father has three daughters .
Please , do not cry .
Where are you going ?
You will not die .
No , I will go with you .
Can you tell me where Portia is ?
Have you seen my brother ?
